{"id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-domination.md","title":"最终支配与无限逃逸","display":"df-domination — 最终支配与无限逃逸","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-domination","aliases":["20-df-domination"],"display":"df-domination — 最终支配与无限逃逸","chapter":"3","section":"3.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 3.5.1–3.5.2","source_pdf_pages":[100],"source_printed_pages":[64],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-domination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-domination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-domination — 最终支配与无限逃逸"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 3.5.1–3.5.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>100</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f,g:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为全函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\le^*g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\ge N\\ [f(n)\\le g(n)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dominant}(g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Escaping}(g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall N\\\n\\exists n\\ge N\\ [g(n)&gt;f(n)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\le^*g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\ge N\\ [f(n)\\le g(n)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dominant}(g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Escaping}(g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall N\\\n\\exists n\\ge N\\ [g(n)&gt;f(n)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有比较只涉及全函数。Dominant 要对每个可计算函数最终不小；Escaping 要对每个可计算函数无限多次超出，两个量词强度不同。严格大于的支配约定可通过加 1 互换。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 3.5.1–3.5.2；印刷页 64；PDF 第 100 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\le^*g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\ge N\\ [f(n)\\le g(n)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dominant}(g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Escaping}(g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall N\\\n\\exists n\\ge N\\ [g(n)>f(n)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a1973e9b4398b95","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low2-domination]]；see [[20-df-domination]]。"},{"id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。"},{"id":"e74d4f391e777166","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]。"},{"id":"c7f202b538b169b2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"2f10383b8be6f0dd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"ee412a4609cb21e2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。"},{"id":"5c18af15d55babd2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]。"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e"]}